# The deploy gate compares these files byte-for-byte with production, and
# build.js writes LF. A Windows checkout that rewrites them to CRLF would look
# like drift and block a deploy that has nothing wrong with it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
